{"id":"52ddba8829989be5","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation.md","title":"73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation — nfa acceptance notation","display":"73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation — nfa acceptance notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation","display":"73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation — nfa acceptance notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-nfa-notation]]","[[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]]","[[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]"],"aliases":["73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation","73-definition-1.4"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation — nfa acceptance notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"222bbfa3171233c2\" href=\"?note=222bbfa3171233c2\" title=\"73-df-nfa-notation\">73-df-nfa-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91c5fa9978cd7fef\" href=\"?note=91c5fa9978cd7fef\" title=\"73-df-nfa-extended-transition\">73-df-nfa-extended-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d700ea676b35b73\" href=\"?note=1d700ea676b35b73\" title=\"73-df-nfa-language-semantics\">73-df-nfa-language-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation</span><span>73-definition-1.4</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in \\mathrm{NFA}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in \\mathrm{NFA}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Q\">\\(q\\in Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\delta}_M\">\\(\\widehat{\\delta}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"91c5fa9978cd7fef\" href=\"?note=91c5fa9978cd7fef\" title=\"73-df-nfa-extended-transition\">73-df-nfa-extended-transition</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1d700ea676b35b73\" href=\"?note=1d700ea676b35b73\" title=\"73-df-nfa-language-semantics\">73-df-nfa-language-semantics</a>；无下标的扩张转移只用于这个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.4}\\vdash\n\\delta^*\\coloneqq\\widehat{\\delta}_M\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.4}\\vdash\n\\delta^*\\coloneqq\\widehat{\\delta}_M\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.4}\\vdash\nM\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\,w\\leftrightarrow \\delta^*(q_0,w)\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.4}\\vdash\nM\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\,w\\leftrightarrow \\delta^*(q_0,w)\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.4}\\vdash\nL(M)=\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:M\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\,w\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.4}\\vdash\nL(M)=\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:M\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\,w\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-nfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"222bbfa3171233c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-extended-transition","status":"resolved","id":"91c5fa9978cd7fef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"1d700ea676b35b73","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-extended-transition","status":"resolved","id":"91c5fa9978cd7fef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M$ 见 [[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]]，$L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]；无下标的扩张转移只用于这个固定 $M$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-language-se